Subject: [PATCH 0032] rs480: force-clock remaining DISP/OV0/VIP + TV cohort

Extend the force-clock table with the remaining benign display candidates: 8
DISP1, 7 DISP2, 33 OV0, and 2 VIP control registers (all validated FORCE
domains), plus 30 TV-out registers under FORCE_TV_SCLK (bit 29).  The TV entries
are a hypothesis under test -- the TV encoder block is powered only with TV-out
active, so a forced-clock read may still stall if the block is unpowered.  GPIO
(separate config-space mechanism), the DAC index port, and CRTC2_STATUS
(read-to-clear) are deliberately excluded.  Node body unchanged.

Assisted-by: Claude (Opus 4.8)
--- a/radeon/rs400.c
+++ b/radeon/rs400.c
